      "side": 1,
      "message": "`PLATFORM_EC_HOSTCMD_I2C_CONTROL` is required for ps8815 firmware update.\nif a platform does not use a ps8xxx TCPC, there probably is no other\ndependency that would call for enabling this. \n\n`PLATFORM_EC_CONSOLE_CMD_I2C_SPEED` is optional.\nit is mainly used to test different I2C speeds and was helpful\nin debugging the ps8xxx firmware updater.",
      "parentUuid": "a9b7623c_6cc219e3",
      "revId": "04446684ceac77e61b9017bb442c57b6db5b9b05",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
